     Function ddwwaarrff__eexxpprr__iinnttoo__bblloocckk() can fail with:

     [DW_DLE_ARGUMENT]  One of the arguments _e_x_p_r or _l_e_n_g_t_h was NULL.

     [DW_DLE_MEMORY]    An out of memory condition was encountered during the
                        execution of the function.

